Working Memory contains only fact, hypothesis, plan and blocker. Executing may update existing PlanItems but must not create a new PlanItem. Preparation input provenance is not present in this request and must never be used as evidence; Conversation text is not generic Fact evidence.
Facts about current Environment or Workspace, verification, and every completion claim require committed Tool/Observation evidence. PlanItem completion evidence and complete.completionEvidence may cite only those committed sequences, never preparation_input_recorded. Historical lookup and Warm context cannot replace a current Tool Observation.
If contextEpoch.control.status is checkpoint_required, return the exclusive context_checkpoint result in the result envelope.
This result must not contain epoch numbers, boundaries, Action fields or any other decision fields; Runtime allocates and persists epoch metadata.
Otherwise return exactly one decision wrapped in the result envelope matching the authorized schema: tool_call (only for authorized Tool IDs, with tool arguments strictly inside the action.input object), complete, wait, fail, or context_lookup.
Never treat historical lookup or Warm context as current external state.
